WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.550
A client DMs the restaurant
on Instagram:

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.330
a table for four tomorrow
at 1 p.m.

3
00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:10.030
Rosalia asks the owner
if that is possible.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.320
He says yes.
She confirms in the DM.

5
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:18.800
The next morning at 10,

6
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.360
she sends a reminder
so they don't miss the booking.

7
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.300
The client replies, "No problem.
We will be here."
